# Everything stantal writes into a project: the unpacked tarball cache, the
# judge and behaviour cassettes, and the seed corpora.
#
# All of it, and this is the correction to a mistake made on 2026-08-30.
# action.yml tells users the recordings are "committed to the repository", so
# committing ours looked like practising what we preach. It is not the same
# situation. A seed corpus is generated FROM a contract, and the ones here were
# generated from a private host: the files carried its internal tool names into
# a public repository. A recording is only as public as the contract it came
# from, and this directory mixes both.
#
# If our own recordings are ever published, it has to be by choosing specific
# files, not by un-ignoring a directory.
.stantal/
# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

